{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"So burrow doesnt work on many surfaces, it dosnt work to get across chasms, it doesnt impart vision.\n\nFlight skips water, casms, wilderness crawls (literally ToA lets you move 2 hexes unless you fly, in which its 10 per day), you get the advantage of vision, and with a bow, or the right cantrips, puts you out of range to be hit.\n\nEven in a dungeon crawl, not touching the floor is far safer than digging through the floor.\n\nBurrow has advantages, but is no where even close to the power of flight","created_at":"2021-08-27T17:54:03.640000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880872809625178182","reply_to_id":"880871810063814657","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"burrow is better than climb by a fair bit, and climb better than swim by a decent bit... but flight, especially in tier 1, is the most broken movement speed by far.","created_at":"2021-08-27T17:55:31.686000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880873178916864040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
